WEBVTT

00:01.521 --> 00:02.858
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.882 --> 00:04.217
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.241 --> 00:07.457
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.481 --> 00:13.041
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.041 --> 01:31.001
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.161 --> 01:34.401
=Episode 5=

01:52.520 --> 01:53.520
Look at the lake.

01:53.960 --> 01:54.960
Is it beautiful?

01:57.921 --> 01:59.281
The landscape falls into the lake.

02:00.041 --> 02:01.561
The cloud is like crystal-clear frost.

02:02.360 --> 02:03.401
It is

02:04.001 --> 02:05.561
the best view in the world indeed.

02:07.641 --> 02:08.921
It's not beautiful now.

02:09.160 --> 02:10.160
It's beautiful with fish.

02:11.281 --> 02:12.281
Where is the fish food?

02:32.081 --> 02:33.081
Look!

02:33.361 --> 02:34.361
Fish!

02:38.200 --> 02:40.081
The golden scales break the blue sky.

02:40.361 --> 02:41.681
It's more beautiful now.

02:42.760 --> 02:44.081
It's not superlative.

02:44.440 --> 02:46.400
The view at the center of the lake
is spectacular.

02:53.401 --> 02:57.201
(Tingchao Pavilion)

02:58.441 --> 03:00.241
(Propitious Omens)

03:02.161 --> 03:03.761
(Imposing and Magnificent)

03:20.161 --> 03:23.281
(Li Yishan, military counselor)

04:14.121 --> 04:20.841
(Imposing and Magnificent)

04:57.481 --> 05:00.001
(Propitious Omens)

05:00.320 --> 05:01.320
Stop here.

05:06.161 --> 05:07.161
What to do now?

05:08.640 --> 05:09.921
Spread the fish food.

05:14.880 --> 05:16.721
Don't be so stingy.

05:23.241 --> 05:24.681
This is the best view.

05:25.561 --> 05:27.681
Don't you take a look?

05:45.960 --> 05:48.241
You are from the Lin family
in Hedong, right?

05:49.520 --> 05:50.520
Yes.

05:51.601 --> 05:52.801
I trust you

05:53.161 --> 05:54.161
about the assassination,

05:55.440 --> 05:57.520
but people gossip.

05:58.320 --> 05:59.801
Your family has to do something

06:00.440 --> 06:01.760
to reassure North Liang.

06:12.400 --> 06:13.400
Mr. Lin?

06:23.561 --> 06:25.361
Your Highness,
you have a big appetite indeed.

06:29.001 --> 06:30.841
Why are you acting like
a different person now?

06:31.121 --> 06:32.121
Things change,

06:35.200 --> 06:36.200
but I'm still who I am.

06:42.561 --> 06:43.880
So, you've been acting.

06:44.001 --> 06:44.538
If not,

06:44.562 --> 06:45.922
how would you let your guard down?

06:46.320 --> 06:47.241
If you don't let your guard down,

06:47.280 --> 06:49.601
how would I have the chance
to be alone with you?

06:50.280 --> 06:51.280
You want to kill me?

06:51.400 --> 06:52.400
Yes.

06:52.561 --> 06:54.601
I came here just to kill you.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.520
What about Miss Fan?

06:57.001 --> 06:58.280
I met her on the way here.

06:58.921 --> 07:00.400
It's a godsend.

07:00.681 --> 07:01.681
That slash of her sword

07:01.760 --> 07:03.520
made you less defensive.

07:04.241 --> 07:05.721
What will happen if you kill me?

07:07.200 --> 07:08.200
If you die,

07:08.681 --> 07:11.200
there will be no future
for the army of Xu!

07:11.440 --> 07:12.161
That's it?

07:12.280 --> 07:13.280
That's it.

07:14.001 --> 07:15.080
I read sage books

07:15.481 --> 07:16.561
to serve the people.

07:17.440 --> 07:19.280
I'm willing to kill the culprit
for my country.

07:20.161 --> 07:22.601
Are you not afraid
that she is a master of martial arts?

07:33.960 --> 07:34.960
I'll take a chance!

07:38.681 --> 07:39.361
You won.

07:39.681 --> 07:40.841
That girl can't fight at all.

07:44.320 --> 07:44.561
You won't

07:44.601 --> 07:45.841
be able to live if you kill me.

07:46.840 --> 07:47.840
What's there to be afraid

07:47.960 --> 07:48.960
to die for my country?

07:49.601 --> 07:50.640
Miss Fan will die, too.

07:52.640 --> 07:53.440
Those who came here with you

07:53.481 --> 07:54.481
will all die.

07:59.880 --> 08:00.880
For the great cause,

08:01.320 --> 08:02.520
one has no fear for sacrifice!

08:02.640 --> 08:03.376
Do they know

08:03.400 --> 08:04.280
that you will sacrifice them?

08:04.361 --> 08:04.921
I'll make amends to them

08:05.080 --> 08:06.320
in the hell!

08:11.320 --> 08:12.960
I know you can't fight,

08:13.601 --> 08:15.640
but I learned swordsmanship
from an early age.

08:16.760 --> 08:17.760
Xu Fengnian.

08:18.481 --> 08:19.801
That smile you just had

08:20.241 --> 08:21.337
should be your last smile

08:21.361 --> 08:22.801
in your life.

08:23.400 --> 08:24.400
I smile

08:24.801 --> 08:26.280
because I finally figure out

08:26.400 --> 08:28.440
the purpose of the three assassinations,

08:29.320 --> 08:30.320
and

08:30.640 --> 08:33.241
who's behind all this.

08:37.361 --> 08:38.520
What are you talking about?

08:38.880 --> 08:40.280
No one orders me to kill you.

08:43.920 --> 08:45.121
You are a pawn.

08:45.961 --> 08:47.961
How would a pawn know
who is playing chess?

08:51.880 --> 08:52.880
Xu Fengnian.

08:53.121 --> 08:54.121
What a pity.

08:54.520 --> 08:56.001
I'm a good swimmer.

09:01.680 --> 09:02.920
Just die under the water!

09:03.920 --> 09:05.001
I couldn't be happier.

10:25.321 --> 10:27.521
I'm not going to save you.

10:58.800 --> 11:00.121
I

11:02.560 --> 11:04.081
Want to eat meat.

12:06.601 --> 12:07.961
Thanks for coming down to save me.

12:10.201 --> 12:10.601
Who...

12:10.640 --> 12:11.640
Who wants to save you?

12:12.121 --> 12:13.800
I want to see how you die.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.680
I must let you down.

12:20.721 --> 12:22.481
What is that thing
at the bottom of the lake?

12:23.160 --> 12:24.560
I call him Old Hunk under the Lake.

12:27.920 --> 12:29.040
Is it a person or a monster?

12:29.241 --> 12:30.321
I guess it's a person.

12:30.920 --> 12:31.601
No way.

12:31.920 --> 12:33.760
How can a man live underwater?

12:35.321 --> 12:36.081
In the first place,

12:36.160 --> 12:37.520
he has strong internal force.

12:37.680 --> 12:38.520
You know

12:38.680 --> 12:41.280
people with strong internal force
have longer breathing intervals.

12:42.160 --> 12:43.441
He still needs air.

12:44.241 --> 12:45.321
There are fish in the lake.

12:46.001 --> 12:47.001
But he's not a fish.

12:48.400 --> 12:49.800
He eats living fish

12:49.880 --> 12:52.321
and rips the swim bladder
from the fish's belly.

12:52.520 --> 12:53.856
There's air inside the swim bladder.

12:53.880 --> 12:54.920
That's how he stays alive.

12:57.280 --> 12:58.680
There's not much air.

12:59.001 --> 13:00.217
With strong internal force,
he doesn't need much air.

13:00.241 --> 13:01.001
He kills a few more fish every day

13:01.040 --> 13:02.040
and just gets through it.

13:05.081 --> 13:06.441
Then when did you find him?

13:07.640 --> 13:09.240
I fell into the lake when I was a child.

13:09.280 --> 13:10.361
He saved my life.

13:10.520 --> 13:12.121
Later, I often threw hot food

13:12.400 --> 13:13.520
into the lake to feed him.

13:13.721 --> 13:14.721
Gradually,

13:14.961 --> 13:15.961
we got familiar.

13:19.201 --> 13:21.280
So, you planned

13:21.601 --> 13:23.040
where to park the boat?

13:26.441 --> 13:27.441
Yeah.

13:30.160 --> 13:32.721
You gave Mr. Lin a chance
to kill you on purpose.

13:33.321 --> 13:34.321
That's right.

13:36.961 --> 13:39.241
You never trusted him the whole time.

13:39.520 --> 13:41.720
What you said and what you did
are just for testing him?

13:43.201 --> 13:44.640
Why would I trust him?

13:46.361 --> 13:47.760
So, you were also testing me

13:47.920 --> 13:49.457
to see if I would join hands with him

13:49.481 --> 13:50.481
in a crisis?

13:51.920 --> 13:52.920
That's not what I meant.

13:54.201 --> 13:55.457
Who knows when you are telling the truth

13:55.481 --> 13:56.481
and when you are lying?

14:01.560 --> 14:03.601
I swear in the name of my mother

14:03.680 --> 14:05.640
that I have no intention of
testing Jiang Ni.

14:09.640 --> 14:10.640
That would be the best.

14:13.680 --> 14:14.760
But I didn't expect you

14:15.121 --> 14:16.441
to jump into the lake to save me.

14:16.520 --> 14:18.280
I said I wasn't trying to save you!

14:21.560 --> 14:22.560
What are you doing?

14:23.920 --> 14:25.720
My clothes are soaked.
It feels uncomfortable.

14:26.841 --> 14:28.001
Stop taking off your clothes.

14:29.201 --> 14:30.760
Keep your underclothes.

14:31.160 --> 14:31.560
Rest assured.

14:31.601 --> 14:32.721
I'm not that shameless.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.080
You are already shameless.

14:36.481 --> 14:37.001
How about you?

14:37.040 --> 14:38.297
Are you not feeling uncomfortable?

14:38.321 --> 14:38.760
I'm not uncomfortable.

14:38.961 --> 14:39.560
I'm fine.

14:39.920 --> 14:40.920
Your sleeves are wet.

14:42.400 --> 14:44.256
I'll gouge your eyes out
if you keep looking at me!

14:44.280 --> 14:45.280
Let's go.

14:46.241 --> 14:47.241
Go by yourself.

14:47.721 --> 14:48.721
I'll be back later.

14:49.481 --> 14:50.376
Your clothes are all wet.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.160
How improper it will be

14:51.201 --> 14:52.201
if someone else sees you!

14:55.001 --> 14:56.001
You walk ahead of me.

14:58.961 --> 14:59.961
Does my back look good?

15:00.961 --> 15:01.961
Very ugly.

15:02.201 --> 15:03.217
Then why are you looking at it?

15:03.241 --> 15:04.241
I'm not!

15:09.201 --> 15:10.256
I jumped into the lake.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.640
You didn't get guards for me,

15:12.601 --> 15:13.721
but you brought me clothes?

15:17.721 --> 15:19.297
Why do I feel
that I can't see through you,

15:19.321 --> 15:19.961
Old Huang?

15:20.280 --> 15:21.800
What's hard to see through me?

15:21.920 --> 15:23.160
Can you stop chatting?

15:23.280 --> 15:24.280
Just one more word.

15:24.560 --> 15:25.560
Guess what I found?

15:29.601 --> 15:30.601
Xu Fengnian!

15:32.121 --> 15:32.640
Young Master.

15:33.040 --> 15:34.481
I didn't let you go!

15:36.160 --> 15:37.160
Wait.

15:37.201 --> 15:38.201
Young Master.

15:38.400 --> 15:39.520
Why did you jump down again?

15:40.560 --> 15:41.560
What did you find?

15:41.601 --> 15:42.601
A big fish?

15:59.441 --> 16:00.441
Look.

16:00.721 --> 16:01.721
I got it back for you.

16:06.121 --> 16:07.361
I don't need it.

16:10.640 --> 16:11.640
Old Huang.

16:11.760 --> 16:13.601
I don't know what it is

16:13.800 --> 16:15.520
and what's in it,

16:16.241 --> 16:17.361
but I know

16:17.601 --> 16:19.177
you've been carrying it with you
for years,

16:19.201 --> 16:20.241
and it's important to you.

16:22.841 --> 16:24.640
That's all in the past.

16:26.400 --> 16:28.160
Why do you deny your past?

16:28.800 --> 16:29.441
Your past

16:29.481 --> 16:30.601
makes who you are now.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.201
No matter what,

16:33.361 --> 16:34.561
you're always Old Huang to me.

16:37.001 --> 16:38.121
If you don't want it anymore

16:38.160 --> 16:39.361
one day,

16:39.800 --> 16:41.280
you need to tell me formally.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.680
The wood is good.

16:43.081 --> 16:44.081
I'll chop it

16:44.481 --> 16:45.560
and roast a duck with it.

16:47.880 --> 16:49.721
Since God wants you to find it,

16:50.841 --> 16:53.281
don't use it to roast a duck.
I can't bear to let you do that.

16:54.160 --> 16:55.680
Don't throw it away again.

16:58.841 --> 17:00.400
I'll leave the man lying there to you.

17:00.841 --> 17:01.841
No problem.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.440
I'll take care of it, Young Master.

18:01.241 --> 18:02.241
You are awake.

18:12.641 --> 18:14.280
What's at the bottom of the lake?

18:16.001 --> 18:17.001
It's my family's lake.

18:17.241 --> 18:18.241
None of your business.

18:31.681 --> 18:32.681
Kill me.

18:34.401 --> 18:35.601
Don't think too much about it.

18:36.760 --> 18:37.481
I'm here

18:37.721 --> 18:39.080
to let you know

18:40.641 --> 18:42.201
the consequences of this assassination.

18:42.800 --> 18:43.800
The consequences?

18:45.760 --> 18:46.760
Although I failed,

18:47.600 --> 18:48.776
there will be other righteous men

18:48.800 --> 18:50.280
coming after you.

18:54.481 --> 18:55.481
No. Mr. Lin.

18:57.441 --> 18:58.881
The Lin family is over.

19:05.120 --> 19:06.921
It's my own decision to assassinate you.

19:07.721 --> 19:09.401
What does it have to do
with my family?

19:11.320 --> 19:12.377
You are the eldest son
of your family.

19:12.401 --> 19:13.080
What do you think?

19:13.241 --> 19:14.360
Isn't it over if I die?

19:15.760 --> 19:17.040
Don't try to kill yourself.

19:17.320 --> 19:18.137
It won't change the result

19:18.161 --> 19:19.161
whether you die or not.

19:21.560 --> 19:23.296
I just assassinated the son of
Lord of North Liang.

19:23.320 --> 19:24.681
I'll get beheaded at worst.

19:24.961 --> 19:26.921
My family won't be implicated.

19:28.921 --> 19:30.481
What about the conspiracy of rebellion?

19:31.961 --> 19:32.961
What rebellion?

19:34.441 --> 19:35.441
The Lin family

19:35.641 --> 19:37.520
colludes with the rebels in secret.

19:37.600 --> 19:38.600
What else could it be

19:39.201 --> 19:40.201
if it's not a rebellion?

19:45.080 --> 19:46.681
There are no rebels!

19:47.881 --> 19:49.681
You're trying to frame my family.

19:51.201 --> 19:53.401
It's just your side of the story.
Who would believe you?

20:03.201 --> 20:04.280
That's why

20:04.961 --> 20:05.760
you have to be more careful

20:05.921 --> 20:07.161
and cautious

20:07.681 --> 20:08.681
when you do things,

20:09.641 --> 20:11.137
so as not to be used as a pawn
and get your family exterminated

20:11.161 --> 20:12.441
without knowing it.

20:14.001 --> 20:15.080
You are talking nonsense

20:15.481 --> 20:16.840
to throw me off balance.

20:18.001 --> 20:19.040
Believe it or not.

20:25.280 --> 20:25.721
Alright.

20:25.840 --> 20:26.840
I'm done.

20:26.881 --> 20:27.881
I'll leave.

20:29.881 --> 20:30.881
Hold on!

20:31.961 --> 20:32.961
What about Miss Fan?

20:33.560 --> 20:34.800
She is in a woman's cell.

20:35.001 --> 20:36.520
Would we lock her up with you?

20:37.641 --> 20:39.161
I used her in this matter.

20:39.360 --> 20:40.560
She has nothing to do with it.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.120
It's too late.

20:42.401 --> 20:44.001
She has been implicated by you.

20:46.600 --> 20:47.600
Xu Fengnian!

20:48.040 --> 20:49.040
Xu Fengnian!

20:54.481 --> 20:56.040
I know you are a righteous man,

20:57.401 --> 20:58.441
but have you thought about

21:00.040 --> 21:01.360
that you might have gone too far?

21:05.721 --> 21:07.040
I don't even know your name.

21:15.760 --> 21:16.760
Never mind.

21:16.800 --> 21:17.800
It's not important.

21:25.961 --> 21:26.961
It's impossible.

21:27.721 --> 21:28.721
It's impossible.

21:29.401 --> 21:30.840
He was just trying to scare me.

21:33.961 --> 21:34.961
Xu Fengnian!

21:35.441 --> 21:36.441
Xu Fengnian!

21:39.961 --> 21:40.961
Xu Fengnian!

22:11.201 --> 22:12.681
Why are you still on the first floor?

22:12.800 --> 22:13.800
I'm reading books.

22:14.881 --> 22:16.457
But there are introductory books
on martial arts on this floor.

22:16.481 --> 22:17.681
You don't need them anymore.

22:18.280 --> 22:19.481
To be the best in the world,

22:19.921 --> 22:21.401
I need to learn from the ground up.

22:24.401 --> 22:25.401
Good luck.

22:26.040 --> 22:26.681
I'll go to see someone.

22:26.760 --> 22:28.360
Your Grandpa Wei
is sleeping in the back.

22:28.961 --> 22:29.961
I'm not looking for him.

22:30.481 --> 22:31.520
I want to see my master.

22:33.241 --> 22:35.481
Didn't you say you couldn't face him

22:35.760 --> 22:36.857
until you unravel
the whole assassination event?

22:36.881 --> 22:37.881
I unraveled it.

22:39.600 --> 22:41.280
You know who's trying to kill you?

22:43.080 --> 22:43.921
I know

22:43.961 --> 22:45.520
who is behind the scenes,

22:46.001 --> 22:46.560
but his purpose

22:46.600 --> 22:47.840
is not to kill me.

22:48.080 --> 22:48.721
The three assassinations

22:48.760 --> 22:50.120
all happened in Lingzhou,

22:50.241 --> 22:51.120
but the result he wants

22:51.161 --> 22:52.320
is thousands of miles away.

22:52.840 --> 22:54.040
I'll tell you in detail later.

22:54.161 --> 22:55.161
That's not necessary.

22:55.481 --> 22:56.721
If it's not about martial arts,

22:56.921 --> 22:58.040
I'm not interested anyway.

23:01.120 --> 23:02.120
I'm leaving.

23:11.481 --> 23:11.961
Master.

23:12.360 --> 23:13.360
I'm back.

23:22.401 --> 23:23.800
Did you unravel

23:24.441 --> 23:25.641
the whole assassination event?

23:25.961 --> 23:26.961
Yes.

23:28.401 --> 23:30.080
Who planned it?

23:31.481 --> 23:32.481
Zhao Heng,

23:32.800 --> 23:34.360
the Lord of Jing'an in Qingzhou.

23:39.681 --> 23:40.681
Be more specific.

23:42.641 --> 23:43.697
In the first round of assassination,

23:43.721 --> 23:45.241
the remaining troops of Chu assembled.

23:45.320 --> 23:46.560
I believe

23:46.760 --> 23:48.960
the Lord of Jing'an must be
the driving force behind it.

23:49.840 --> 23:51.177
In the second round of assassination,

23:51.201 --> 23:53.321
Yu Youwei is the daughter
of a swordsman from the Chu.

23:53.840 --> 23:55.920
She acted like she wanted
to avenge her lost country.

23:58.201 --> 23:59.401
Xu Xiao annihilated the Chu.

23:59.921 --> 24:01.161
Who else should I kill but you?

24:01.520 --> 24:03.977
Zhao Heng kept Yu Youwei

24:04.001 --> 24:05.001
for such a day.

24:09.241 --> 24:11.401
Lin initiated
the third round of assassination,

24:12.120 --> 24:13.481
which is the most important round.

24:14.081 --> 24:14.977
(Noodles)

24:15.001 --> 24:16.001
He wants to kill me

24:16.080 --> 24:17.080
because he believes

24:17.441 --> 24:19.001
that North Liang endangers the country.

24:19.641 --> 24:20.641
But all this

24:21.161 --> 24:21.721
can't be done

24:21.760 --> 24:23.840
without Zhao Heng,
being the driving force behind it.

24:24.320 --> 24:25.320
What's the evidence?

24:25.560 --> 24:26.560
There isn't any evidence.

24:27.120 --> 24:28.881
Even Lin himself wouldn't know

24:29.800 --> 24:30.840
that he wants to kill me

24:31.280 --> 24:33.641
because he was subtly influenced
by the Lord of Jing'an.

24:34.800 --> 24:35.921
What are you talking about?

24:36.360 --> 24:37.681
No one orders me to kill you.

24:38.641 --> 24:39.401
Once Lin made a move,

24:39.520 --> 24:40.280
everyone would think

24:40.320 --> 24:42.417
that the Lin family joined hands
with the Chu veterans,

24:42.441 --> 24:43.441
and what he did

24:43.881 --> 24:45.120
became treasonous in nature.

24:46.320 --> 24:47.320
So,

24:48.360 --> 24:49.360
the Lin family is over.

24:51.040 --> 24:55.161
Then why would Zhao Heng

24:56.120 --> 24:57.401
try to make all of this happen?

24:58.001 --> 25:00.881
Qingzhou is one of the key areas
to defend against North Liang.

25:01.241 --> 25:03.120
(Qingzhou)
Zhao Heng commands Qingzhou

25:03.401 --> 25:04.657
(Qingzhou)
and controls the Navy.

25:04.681 --> 25:05.681
You can say

25:05.721 --> 25:07.721
(Lingzhou)
that he grabs North Liang by the throat.

25:08.800 --> 25:10.921
But he did contend
for the throne before.

25:11.401 --> 25:12.840
The court doesn't trust him.

25:13.520 --> 25:14.657
That's why it has been
the Lin family in Hedong

25:14.681 --> 25:16.721
who has the fiscal control of Qingzhou.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.881
After three rounds of assassination,

25:21.001 --> 25:23.721
the Lin family would fall into
the whirlpool of treason.

25:25.481 --> 25:26.721
They can't be saved.

25:34.360 --> 25:35.401
After that,

25:35.921 --> 25:36.961
the fall of the Lin family

25:38.120 --> 25:40.961
would leave the Lord of Jing'an
in sole control of Qingzhou.

25:41.800 --> 25:43.280
No one can play against him anymore.

25:46.080 --> 25:47.320
He planned all this

25:49.001 --> 25:50.201
not to kill me,

25:52.080 --> 25:52.898
but

25:52.922 --> 25:55.201
to take full control of Qingzhou.

26:02.600 --> 26:04.120
A series of lethal moves.

26:04.961 --> 26:06.320
The real game

26:07.320 --> 26:08.401
is outside the chessboard.

26:09.520 --> 26:11.480
The cause and effect
are thousands of miles apart.

26:13.401 --> 26:14.961
The Lord of Jing'an, Zhao Heng,

26:16.961 --> 26:18.760
is a scary player indeed.

26:21.360 --> 26:23.681
What if you get killed?

26:24.560 --> 26:25.560
If I die,

26:25.721 --> 26:26.921
North Liang would be in chaos.

26:27.681 --> 26:28.961
It would do good to Qingzhou.

26:31.120 --> 26:32.560
The Lord of Jing'an would win anyway

26:33.241 --> 26:35.280
in this game.

26:37.840 --> 26:39.201
You haven't seen through

26:40.280 --> 26:42.600
this game.

27:11.840 --> 27:12.840
Who are you?

27:17.481 --> 27:19.520
I am the usurper.

27:22.441 --> 27:23.441
Look.

27:24.001 --> 27:25.401
I'm standing right in front of you.

27:25.560 --> 27:26.720
You don't even know who I am.

27:33.120 --> 27:34.120
Xu Xiao?

27:36.641 --> 27:37.840
Actually,

27:38.801 --> 27:41.281
I kind of appreciate you.

27:44.881 --> 27:46.361
You want to persuade me to surrender?

27:47.721 --> 27:48.721
Xu Xiao.

27:49.161 --> 27:51.560
It can only happen in your dream

27:52.360 --> 27:53.921
to make me serve a usurper.

27:56.600 --> 27:58.280
You are so righteous.

27:58.800 --> 28:01.040
I'm embarrassed to keep lying to you.

28:02.080 --> 28:03.080
What do you want to say?

28:04.241 --> 28:05.241
Come in!

28:07.280 --> 28:08.280
Brother Lin.

28:08.401 --> 28:09.401
Miss Fan.

28:09.481 --> 28:10.001
Xu Xiao!

28:10.481 --> 28:11.681
It has nothing to do with her!

28:12.760 --> 28:13.760
Brother Lin.

28:16.681 --> 28:17.881
Did they release you?

28:21.360 --> 28:22.881
I lied to you.

28:24.280 --> 28:25.280
You can hit me

28:26.040 --> 28:27.040
and scold me.

28:27.481 --> 28:29.001
I deserve it.

28:30.201 --> 28:31.201
I'm not wronged.

28:49.040 --> 28:50.280
We are all acting.

28:54.560 --> 28:55.721
Did I do a good job?

29:02.441 --> 29:02.800
You...

29:03.040 --> 29:04.040
Lin.

29:04.161 --> 29:05.161
Do you really think

29:05.600 --> 29:08.080
we met by accident?

29:10.481 --> 29:11.481
I had her

29:12.161 --> 29:13.600
waiting for you

29:14.481 --> 29:15.280
on the way

29:15.441 --> 29:16.681
when you left your mansion.

29:18.560 --> 29:19.560
Why?

29:20.600 --> 29:21.600
First of all,

29:22.080 --> 29:23.080
the assassination

29:23.360 --> 29:24.360
entered

29:24.681 --> 29:25.681
the third round.

29:27.040 --> 29:27.721
I must let her give you a push

29:27.760 --> 29:29.760
at the crucial moment.

29:31.040 --> 29:31.481
Second,

29:31.560 --> 29:33.161
my son must find out

29:33.201 --> 29:34.840
who Qingniao is.

29:35.120 --> 29:36.120
Therefore,

29:36.560 --> 29:39.120
she must wield her sword.

29:40.401 --> 29:41.881
How hard it is for me to be a father.

29:42.760 --> 29:43.600
I have to find a way

29:43.641 --> 29:46.080
to give my son what he wants.

29:46.481 --> 29:47.481
Am I right?

29:49.001 --> 29:49.600
What's more,

29:49.921 --> 29:51.001
with my words,

29:51.201 --> 29:53.641
it would be set in stone
that the Lin family

29:53.840 --> 29:55.120
colludes with the Chu survivors.

29:55.401 --> 29:56.921
There is no chance

29:57.241 --> 29:58.241
to turn the tide.

30:05.641 --> 30:06.280
Xu Xiao!

30:06.401 --> 30:07.600
You treacherous man!

30:08.840 --> 30:09.840
The planning is done.

30:11.040 --> 30:12.080
I have told you the truth.

30:12.201 --> 30:12.921
Regard it

30:13.161 --> 30:15.560
as my respect for your righteousness.

30:17.760 --> 30:18.760
Shu Xiu!

30:20.721 --> 30:21.721
Grand Commander.

30:22.641 --> 30:24.520
Send a message to Wang Linquan

30:24.881 --> 30:25.441
that

30:25.760 --> 30:27.481
the Lin family is over.

30:28.360 --> 30:31.040
Make sure he will destroy

30:31.241 --> 30:33.001
the lifeblood of the Lin family
step by step.

30:37.520 --> 30:39.641
Zhao Heng has always wanted
to destroy the Lin family

30:39.681 --> 30:40.841
and dominate Qingzhou, right?

30:42.280 --> 30:43.280
Good.

30:43.401 --> 30:44.881
Let's give him a hand.

30:45.961 --> 30:47.280
The Lord of Jing'an doesn't know

30:47.760 --> 30:49.160
that although the Lin family falls,

30:49.520 --> 30:51.840
his henchman who will take over
Qingzhou's fiscal power

30:52.401 --> 30:53.401
is actually

30:53.721 --> 30:55.217
from North Liang

30:55.241 --> 30:56.881
who has been planted
by his side long ago.

31:00.800 --> 31:02.001
This is a good game

31:03.241 --> 31:04.241
indeed.

31:07.120 --> 31:08.120
Go ahead.

31:17.881 --> 31:18.961
I need to thank you

31:19.320 --> 31:20.641
for this whole thing.

31:22.481 --> 31:23.641
Your name is Lin...

31:24.080 --> 31:24.377
Lin...

31:24.401 --> 31:25.401
Lin...

31:25.560 --> 31:26.760
Never mind. It doesn't matter.

31:57.441 --> 31:58.801
You mean Xu Xiao has been prepared

31:59.241 --> 32:00.360
for this game?

32:01.080 --> 32:02.080
It's more than that.

32:02.161 --> 32:03.401
Could there be a deeper layer?

32:05.441 --> 32:06.840
You must always keep in mind

32:07.040 --> 32:08.120
that what you need to see

32:08.961 --> 32:10.721
is not just the game,

32:11.721 --> 32:12.721
but also

32:13.040 --> 32:16.120
the secret plan of the chess player.

32:20.760 --> 32:24.641
I think you know the deepest dungeon

32:25.080 --> 32:26.080
in the mansion.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.520
Yes.

32:28.040 --> 32:29.040
Go there and take a look.

32:29.441 --> 32:30.840
Maybe you'll understand.

32:31.120 --> 32:33.096
Access to the deepest level
requires Xu Xiao's warrant.

32:33.120 --> 32:34.120
I don't have it.

32:40.520 --> 32:41.641
This will do.

32:44.520 --> 32:46.320
What do you want me to see?

32:46.441 --> 32:47.921
What else could it be?

32:48.641 --> 32:50.001
It's a person.

32:51.560 --> 32:52.921
Someone you know.

33:02.840 --> 33:03.840
Show your warrant.

33:25.881 --> 33:26.881
Why are you here?

33:30.120 --> 33:31.360
Did you forget

33:31.840 --> 33:33.040
it was you who gave the order?

33:33.241 --> 33:34.001
Soldier!

33:34.120 --> 33:34.961
Put this rebel

33:35.080 --> 33:36.481
in jail!

33:36.800 --> 33:38.280
But I've set you free.

33:39.161 --> 33:40.481
I'm afraid you got it wrong.

33:42.280 --> 33:43.840
Ning Emei is an honest man.

33:44.280 --> 33:45.280
Make up an excuse

33:45.360 --> 33:46.360
and release him.

33:50.001 --> 33:51.161
Do you know Lin?

33:52.921 --> 33:53.921
Who?

33:54.921 --> 33:55.921
You don't know him.

33:56.401 --> 33:58.561
You have nothing to do
with the Lin family's operation.

33:59.961 --> 34:01.561
Did you ask Yu Youwei to assassinate me?

34:01.921 --> 34:02.800
If you want to kill me,

34:02.840 --> 34:04.040
just do it.

34:04.241 --> 34:05.801
Why bother to fabricate a charge on me?

34:05.840 --> 34:07.600
You have nothing to do with Yu Youwei.

34:09.200 --> 34:10.881
Could it be outside Lingzhou...?

34:10.921 --> 34:11.921
No.

34:12.640 --> 34:13.640
It was you

34:13.761 --> 34:14.841
who showed up in time

34:14.881 --> 34:16.201
and saved me from the Chu people.

34:18.200 --> 34:19.977
You have nothing to do
with three assassinations.

34:20.001 --> 34:21.001
Why are you here?

34:21.520 --> 34:23.040
On the lowest floor of the dungeon?

34:54.160 --> 34:55.160
You are also here.

35:09.001 --> 35:10.080
Dig deeper.

35:12.160 --> 35:13.160
Okay.

35:13.801 --> 35:14.801
Leave us.

35:33.441 --> 35:34.441
You want to see me?

35:34.881 --> 35:36.761
Why is Ning Emei
still locked up in the dungeon?

35:39.720 --> 35:41.000
It's something I shouldn't know?

35:42.040 --> 35:43.680
You'll know it sooner or later.

35:44.281 --> 35:45.361
I didn't tell you

35:45.481 --> 35:46.761
because

35:47.240 --> 35:48.840
I don't want
to put you in that position.

35:52.321 --> 35:53.321
Is it a big deal?

35:54.120 --> 35:55.160
Do you know

35:55.481 --> 35:56.881
where our greatest enemy is?

35:59.080 --> 35:59.600
North Mang?

35:59.640 --> 36:00.640
Not there.

36:00.720 --> 36:01.720
The capital?

36:02.520 --> 36:03.600
The royal clan

36:03.640 --> 36:05.441
is indeed wary of North Liang,

36:05.560 --> 36:06.560
but they are still

36:06.600 --> 36:08.040
foreign enemies.

36:08.441 --> 36:09.520
You mean

36:10.600 --> 36:12.001
North Liang's greatest enemy

36:12.080 --> 36:13.080
is inside of us?

36:13.720 --> 36:14.720
That's right.

36:15.361 --> 36:17.560
The North Liang Cavalry
is unparalleled in the world.

36:17.961 --> 36:19.817
The only way to destroy
the foundation of North Liang

36:19.841 --> 36:20.841
is to start from

36:21.160 --> 36:22.160
the inside.

36:22.240 --> 36:23.960
Does Ning Emei
collude with foreign enemies?

36:24.040 --> 36:24.441
No.

36:24.921 --> 36:26.001
Is he plotting a rebellion?

36:26.560 --> 36:27.560
He is loyal.

36:28.281 --> 36:29.720
Then why did you lock him up?

36:30.881 --> 36:32.281
He supports your younger brother.

36:34.001 --> 36:35.001
What did you say?

37:20.961 --> 37:21.961
Get up.

37:22.441 --> 37:23.441
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

37:24.200 --> 37:25.080
Huangman'er

37:25.200 --> 37:26.401
was born with great strength.

37:27.240 --> 37:28.240
He has

37:28.640 --> 37:30.680
plenty of supporters in the army.

37:31.160 --> 37:32.160
Isn't it a good thing?

37:32.441 --> 37:33.281
There are even people

37:33.321 --> 37:34.321
supporting him

37:34.361 --> 37:35.441
to take over military power

37:35.640 --> 37:36.841
and rule North Liang.

37:37.040 --> 37:38.361
Ning Emei is one of them?

37:39.361 --> 37:41.600
So, you're going to kill him yourself

37:41.921 --> 37:42.881
to stabilize the army.

37:42.921 --> 37:44.680
Just for that?

37:45.040 --> 37:45.560
Wait,

37:45.600 --> 37:46.656
they want your younger brother

37:46.680 --> 37:47.921
to take your place.

37:48.401 --> 37:48.921
What's wrong with

37:48.961 --> 37:49.761
letting him take my place?

37:49.841 --> 37:50.841
I don't want it anyway.

37:55.080 --> 37:56.080
Do you know

37:56.200 --> 37:58.200
why they support him?

37:58.680 --> 38:00.120
You just said yourself

38:00.481 --> 38:01.401
that Huangman'er was born
with great strength.

38:01.441 --> 38:03.680
But he has the mind of a child.

38:05.120 --> 38:06.680
The royal clan is coveting North Liang.

38:06.801 --> 38:08.241
There are countless foreign enemies.

38:08.401 --> 38:09.321
How do you expect your brother

38:09.361 --> 38:10.441
to take control over

38:10.600 --> 38:11.600
such a situation?

38:14.921 --> 38:15.921
Those who support him

38:16.560 --> 38:17.801
don't know that?

38:18.720 --> 38:20.481
Why do they choose Huangman'er?

38:21.040 --> 38:21.841
Just because

38:21.921 --> 38:23.441
he is naive

38:23.481 --> 38:24.761
and easy to control.

38:25.761 --> 38:26.761
If

38:26.801 --> 38:27.640
Your little brother

38:27.720 --> 38:28.881
takes over North Liang,

38:29.361 --> 38:30.801
he will become

38:30.841 --> 38:33.200
a pawn of those schemers.

38:33.720 --> 38:34.600
When that day comes,

38:34.640 --> 38:35.640
the Xu family

38:35.841 --> 38:37.361
will be doomed.

38:38.961 --> 38:41.080
Ning Emei doesn't look like a schemer.

38:42.200 --> 38:44.640
He certainly wasn't trying
to control your brother.

38:44.881 --> 38:46.680
He just

38:46.921 --> 38:47.921
admires Huangman'er.

38:48.200 --> 38:49.720
Men like him in the army

38:49.761 --> 38:50.720
are pawns

38:50.761 --> 38:52.720
put on the surface by those people.

38:53.240 --> 38:54.801
Then who are the people

38:54.841 --> 38:55.640
trying to take this chance

38:55.720 --> 38:56.720
to control North Liang?

38:56.881 --> 38:57.520
I'm still looking into it.

38:57.801 --> 38:58.801
No hurry.

38:59.240 --> 39:01.120
Kill Ning Emei first.

39:01.160 --> 39:03.240
That will be a wake-up call for them.

39:04.401 --> 39:06.080
But I need a charge to kill Ning Emei.

39:06.680 --> 39:08.600
The assassination
of Lord of North Liang's son.

39:09.080 --> 39:09.881
There are only words

39:09.921 --> 39:10.921
without evidence.

39:10.961 --> 39:11.961
Who would believe it?

39:12.080 --> 39:13.257
If I kill Ning Emei like this,

39:13.281 --> 39:14.857
it will undermine
the morale of the army.

39:14.881 --> 39:16.281
Who said there is no evidence?

39:17.560 --> 39:19.160
Do you remember

39:19.560 --> 39:21.361
someone sent your portrait
to the bandits

39:21.841 --> 39:23.321
in the first round of assassination?

39:26.240 --> 39:27.240
I'll find out

39:27.640 --> 39:29.001
about the portrait for you.

39:31.720 --> 39:33.040
He colluded with foreign enemies.

39:33.321 --> 39:35.441
It's a crime deserving
the death penalty.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.560
Was it really Ning Emei

39:38.040 --> 39:39.441
who sent out the portrait?

39:39.881 --> 39:40.881
Is it that important

39:41.120 --> 39:42.120
whether he did it or not?

39:43.080 --> 39:44.680
Who gave the portrait to the Chu people?

40:06.361 --> 40:08.240
You gave them the portrait?

40:09.200 --> 40:10.200
Look.

40:10.441 --> 40:11.441
Look at it.

40:13.921 --> 40:15.081
I picked one

40:26.120 --> 40:27.120
The Lord of Jing'an

40:27.801 --> 40:28.600
plotted assassinations

40:28.680 --> 40:30.200
for the fiscal power of Qingzhou,

40:31.640 --> 40:32.961
and you played along

40:34.680 --> 40:36.281
to root out dissenters.

40:39.401 --> 40:41.401
Ning Emei also
has supporters in the army.

40:43.160 --> 40:44.281
As long as we convict him

40:44.321 --> 40:45.761
of collusion with the enemy,

40:47.361 --> 40:48.361
we can kill him.

40:49.560 --> 40:51.120
Even he's innocent?

40:52.160 --> 40:53.401
North Liang can't be in chaos.

40:54.040 --> 40:55.361
We have to kill him

40:55.720 --> 40:57.281
to stabilize the army.

40:58.080 --> 40:59.361
North Liang can't be in chaos.

41:00.080 --> 41:01.881
That's also what Chen Zhibao said.

41:02.040 --> 41:03.160
He also knows it, right?

41:06.200 --> 41:07.600
You're my oldest son.

41:07.921 --> 41:09.080
What we did

41:09.361 --> 41:11.001
is for your good.

41:13.401 --> 41:14.720
I won't kill Ning Emei.

41:15.961 --> 41:16.961
Fengnian.

41:17.560 --> 41:18.640
Your last name is Xu.

41:19.441 --> 41:20.600
To protect North Liang

41:20.640 --> 41:21.481
is one of

41:21.520 --> 41:23.080
your inherent responsibilities.

41:23.120 --> 41:23.577
So, I can kill innocent people

41:23.601 --> 41:25.401
for the sake of North Liang?

41:29.560 --> 41:30.801
I won't kill Ning Emei.

41:34.080 --> 41:35.080
Okay.

41:37.961 --> 41:39.080
You don't have to kill him.

41:42.080 --> 41:43.801
There's a second option.

41:44.921 --> 41:45.921
If

41:46.961 --> 41:48.600
Huangman'er is gone,

41:49.080 --> 41:50.401
there will be

41:50.761 --> 41:53.120
no fight over power anymore.

41:55.281 --> 41:57.401
Do you know what you're talking about?

42:01.160 --> 42:02.481
That's not what I meant.

42:03.040 --> 42:04.761
Even a vicious tiger
will not eat its cubs.

42:05.281 --> 42:06.521
What do you mean by he is gone?

42:06.841 --> 42:08.761
Make Huangman'er leave North Liang.

42:10.560 --> 42:11.560
Enough!

42:11.801 --> 42:13.321
Whether you kill Ning Emei

42:14.080 --> 42:15.720
to punish those ambitious men
in the army,

42:16.120 --> 42:17.640
or I send Huangman'er away

42:17.961 --> 42:18.680
to solve this problem for good.

42:18.761 --> 42:19.801
You have to make a choice.

42:20.401 --> 42:21.801
I'm not going to choose either one.

42:24.520 --> 42:25.520
North Liang occupies

42:25.560 --> 42:26.560
the land of three states

42:26.961 --> 42:29.240
and commands
the cavalry of 350,000 soldiers.

42:29.761 --> 42:31.321
To guard such a vast land,

42:31.361 --> 42:33.481
how can you not get blood on your hands?

42:33.520 --> 42:34.401
That's why I said

42:34.441 --> 42:36.080
I never wanted it!

42:36.281 --> 42:37.561
What about North Liang's future?

42:37.640 --> 42:39.440
Don't they call Chen Zhibao
the Little Slayer?

42:39.600 --> 42:40.600
He is the ideal person!

42:42.761 --> 42:44.120
I've made myself clear.

42:45.720 --> 42:47.040
Huangman'er can't leave.

42:47.761 --> 42:49.240
Ning Emei can't be killed.

42:52.080 --> 42:53.080
So be it.

44:56.841 --> 45:00.681
♪ The flower of pain ♪
